00:04:46.210 --> 00:04:46.830
Really?

00:04:46.830 --> 00:04:47.920
Power stones?

00:04:48.290 --> 00:04:52.300
I think I saw the Tokorozawa captain with one.

00:04:52.300 --> 00:04:55.130
Yeah, I gave that to Masami.

00:04:55.130 --> 00:04:57.340
The Higashi Murayama leader had one too.

00:04:57.340 --> 00:04:58.140
What?

00:05:00.260 --> 00:05:03.980
Oh yeah, this <i>does</i> look like the thing on Shigyo's neck.

00:05:06.230 --> 00:05:08.770
I don't know if they're the same thing,

00:05:08.770 --> 00:05:12.690
