00:06:42.970 --> 00:06:45.740
The Dynamite Bombers sent another warning note!

00:06:45.740 --> 00:06:47.290
What?

00:06:47.640 --> 00:06:49.780
I'm getting kind of nervous now.

00:06:49.780 --> 00:06:52.040
Isn't Tokyo scary?

00:06:52.330 --> 00:06:53.880
I don't know about that.

00:06:53.880 --> 00:06:57.280
My older brother said the other countries are all pretty similar.

00:06:57.280 --> 00:06:58.640
You have an older brother?

00:06:58.640 --> 00:06:59.300
Yes.

00:06:59.680 --> 00:07:04.560
Oh yeah, the people that helped me when I collapsed in the street were very nice.

00:07:05.110 --> 00:07:07.130
Do you collapse in the street often?

00:07:07.130 --> 00:07:08.380
Yeah.

00:07:08.380 --> 00:07:11.080
I often can't get to my destination,

00:07:11.080 --> 00:07:14.640
and sometimes I forget where I am...

00:07:14.640 --> 00:07:16.190
R-Really...

00:07:16.190 --> 00:07:20.130
I don't think it's because I'm bad with directions though.

00:07:20.130 --> 00:07:22.700
<i>No, I think that's exactly what it is.</i>

00:07:23.120 --> 00:07:23.160
Have your
passport ready.

