My neck is killing me! I slept on it funny.

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:33.580
Huh? Who? What? Where?

00:07:33.930 --> 00:07:35.170
Oh!

00:07:35.170 --> 00:07:37.530
<i>This one's a total mess.</i>

00:07:39.730 --> 00:07:41.300
<i>And what's the deal with that mask?</i>

00:07:45.060 --> 00:07:47.710
<i>I guess everyone's a little strange...</i>

00:07:49.530 --> 00:07:51.110
Oh, that song—

