00:14:57.910 --> 00:14:59.240
Masami!

00:14:59.530 --> 00:15:01.290
I'll bring her back!

00:15:01.290 --> 00:15:03.620
Wait, you can't! You're still injured!

00:15:04.160 --> 00:15:08.070
