Moritomo Fried Dango

00:15:10.760 --> 00:15:11.470
Hey, Masami! Hey!

00:15:11.470 --> 00:15:13.270
Masami, don't go into the light!
Hey, Masami! Hey!

00:15:13.270 --> 00:15:13.730
Masami, don't go into the light!

00:15:13.730 --> 00:15:14.670
Masami!
Masami, don't go into the light!

