Miss Shigyo!

00:15:34.420 --> 00:15:35.890
I'm so sorry!

00:15:35.890 --> 00:15:39.150
I can't find your Heroic Garnet any...

00:15:39.150 --> 00:15:40.180
where.

00:15:45.730 --> 00:15:48.380
Those guys are definitely Rests.

00:15:48.380 --> 00:15:50.780
I severely doubt this stone exists.

00:15:50.780 --> 00:15:53.540
They're likely trying to buy time for their friends to come for them.

00:15:53.960 --> 00:15:58.160
My plan is to let them go, tail them, and then capture them all in one fell swoop!

00:16:00.890 --> 00:16:03.110
I doubt we'll find it.

00:16:03.110 --> 00:16:05.390
She said it was stolen.

00:16:05.730 --> 00:16:07.940
We'll never know unless we try!

00:16:08.850 --> 00:16:12.090
Oh, sorry for getting you all involved too.

